  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090010,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あっ、プロデューサーさん……\r\nお疲れさまです",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "016",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れさま、千雪\r\n……隣、いいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090020,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ええ、どうぞ……あら？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、\r\nジャケットの裾、ほつれちゃってるみたいです",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え……ああ、ほんとだ\r\n恥ずかしいな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090040,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふ、直しますね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……いや、何言ってるんだ\r\n今、戻ってきたばっかりじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……？\r\nだって、気になりません……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0152",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "よいしょ……っと、はい、プロデューサーさん\r\n裾、見せてくださいね～",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ、……ありがとう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい♪",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ふぅ……千雪には敵わないな……\r\n今、優勝したとこなんだぞ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい♪",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、うーん……\r\nも、ものすごい快挙なんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……はい\r\n私もまだ、半分は信じられないような気持ちです",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090090"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "それに、疲れてないのかなって自分でも思うんですけど……\r\n不思議と、全然疲れてないんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090100"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090110,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "なんだか、静かなドキドキがずっと続いていて……\r\n足元が、ふわふわしている感じで",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nはは、まだ、興奮が残っているんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090120,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そうだと思います\r\n……ふふ、『W.I.N.G.』優勝だなんて",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090130,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "毎日、いろんなことがありすぎて\r\nあれこれやってたら、いつの間にか……って感じです",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん……\r\n俺も正直なところ、そんな感じだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "不思議だよな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090140,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……よし、と\r\nできました♪",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、サンキュー、千雪\r\nなんか、最初に声かけたときもこんなだったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090150,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふっ、プロデューサーさん、\r\nボタンがすっごくグラグラだったんですもん……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、自分でも甲斐性ないなって思うよ\r\nこの裾だって……気づいてくれてありがとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090160,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そ、そんな……\r\nどういたしまして",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090160"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090170,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "でも……ほんとに不思議\r\nあの時とは、いろんなことが変わっちゃいましたね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだよなぁ\r\n千雪はすごいアイドルになったし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090180,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "もう、またそういう言い方……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、これは本心なんだから、変えないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、千雪はいつでも千雪だよ\r\nなんか、逆のことを言うみたいだけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090190,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふ、ええ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結局、雑貨もアイドルも、どっちも諦めなかったしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090200,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ええ\r\nでも、私……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090200"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090210,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "どっちかだけの未来って\r\nなかったんじゃないかなって気がするんです",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090210"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090220,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんに、出会っちゃいましたからね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090230,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい\r\n誰かを……たくさんの人を笑顔にできるって……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090230"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090240,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "私にも、そういうことができるんだって、\r\nプ、プロデューサーさんが……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090240"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090250,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんが、教えてくれたんです……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090260,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "雑貨も、アイドルも、\r\nプロデューサーさんがいてくださったから諦めずに済んだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090260"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090270,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "というより、両方が、両方を輝かせてくれるんだって……\r\nそういうことにも気づかせてもらえました",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/601600109/6016001090270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\n千雪、ありがとうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6016001090280,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "もう……\r\nそれは私のセリフなんです～……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
